pos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120267","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120267","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120267.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120267.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-15T17:00:28Z"},"body":"By default Jolt returns 1 hit per intersecting triangle of a ConcavePolygonShape3D. ShapeResult only contains the ID of the leaf shape and not the triangle ID. This means that when the query intersects with multiple triangles of the same leaf shape, there will be multiple duplicate results. Rewrote the query to return max 1 hit per leaf shape.\r\n\r\nCloses #119868 \r\n\r\nHere is an updated the MRP that includes multiple bodies and a body that is outside of the query shape to see that it gets ignored:\r\n\r\n[intersect-shape-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28917531/intersect-shape-test.zip)\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120267/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":